   ******************************
   *** Spin-orbit calculation ***
   ******************************


   Spin-orbit matrix elements
   ==========================

  

 PROGRAM * SEWLS (Spin-orbit & spin-spin integral evaluation)

 Modified from original SEWARD code by Alexander Mitrushchenkov
 
